        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Good morning, private banking, Melissa Goh speaking. Hello, Adrian. Have you got a quiet moment to talk, or are you calling between meetings at the office?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Hi Melissa. I'm at the office, but I've closed the door. I've got a short gap before the next meeting, so a telephone call is easiest for me."
