        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you. That's the identity check completed. I remember you prefer telephone contact rather than trying to fit a branch visit into your working day."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Yes, the family business keeps me quite occupied. Even when I put aside time for personal administration, something comes up. On the phone, at least I can deal with things directly."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Let me refer to the information on file. [[EV_001]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "I've brought my notes along, so I won't have to search through my emails while we're speaking."
        },
        {
