          "text": "[[EV_010]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Before we finish, on contact arrangements, would you prefer us to ring your mobile rather than the office line for any administrative follow-up?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Mobile, please. The office line goes through reception, and I'm sometimes in the warehouse or visiting customers. If I miss your call, just leave a brief message."
